---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About CA Manu Sharma | Dynamics 365 F&O Professional"
  description="Learn about CA Manu Sharma's professional journey, philosophy, and expertise in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", url: "/" },
    { name: "About", url: "/about" }
  ]}
>
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-primary-50 text-primary mb-6 shadow-sm border border-primary/20">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black font-display text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">
        About Me
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Hi, I'm CA Manu Sharma. I am a passionate Senior Functional Consultant specializing in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance &amp; Operations. My goal is to bridge the gap between complex business requirements and scalable, performant ERP architecture.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/camanusharma/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-700 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-50 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/></svg>
          Connect on LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-purple prose-lg text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-display text-slate-900 mb-4">My Philosophy</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        I believe that a successful Dynamics 365 implementation is not just about writing code or clicking through configurations; it's about deeply understanding the core financial and operational business processes. A solid architectural foundation on day one prevents severe technical debt and performance bottlenecks down the road.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-display text-slate-900 mb-4 mt-12">Core Module Expertise</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Throughout my career, I have gained extensive hands-on experience architecting and implementing the following Dynamics 365 F&O modules across various industries (including Manufacturing, Retail, and Food Processing):
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6 mb-12">
        <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> General Ledger</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> AP, AR and Cash &amp; Bank</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> Credit and Collections</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> Subscription Billing</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> PMA (Project Management &amp; Accounting)</li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> Fixed Assets &amp; Asset Leasing</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> Tax (Including Indian &amp; Oman Localizations)</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> Procurement &amp; Sales</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> Inventory &amp; Production Postings</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">✓</span> Management Reporter (Financial Reporting)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-display text-slate-900 mb-4">Sharing Knowledge</h2>
      <p class="mb-8">
        I am deeply passionate about the Microsoft community. Beyond my day-to-day role, I actively share technical guides, architecture playbooks, and development patterns on this blog. My goal is to help other consultants and developers navigate the complexities of D365 F&O, from Data Management Framework (DMF) optimizations to clean Chain of Command (CoC) development.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold font-display text-slate-900 mb-6">Let's Connect</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-10">
        Whether you want to discuss Dynamics 365 architecture, share insights, or just expand your professional network, I'm always open to connecting with fellow ERP professionals.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-bold text-white bg-primary hover:bg-primary-600 transition-all shadow-md"
      >
        <span>Send a Message</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
